import{_ as t,o as i,c as n,a2 as a}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const d=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 759 | Hyper-Multiverse-Grade Rules | The Rule Practice of the Law-First Axiom","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 759 | Hyper-Multiverse-Grade Rules | The Rule Practice of the Law-First Axiom","no":759,"module":4,"tags":["Hyper-Multiverse-Grade Rules","Law-First Axiom","Self-Consistency","No Book-Eating","Setting-Priority"],"related":["97-Setting-Contradiction Self-Check Table","04-Anti-Predation Core Treatise","40-Symbiotic Constitution Overview"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0759_模块4-超多元级规则-法则优先公理实践.md","filePath":"en/0759_模块4-超多元级规则-法则优先公理实践.md"}'),o={name:"en/0759_模块4-超多元级规则-法则优先公理实践.md"};function s(r,e,l,h,u,c){return i(),n("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[a('<h1 id="entry-759-hyper-multiverse-grade-rules-the-rule-practice-of-the-law-first-axiom" tabindex="-1">Entry 759 | Hyper-Multiverse-Grade Rules | The Rule Practice of the Law-First Axiom <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-759-hyper-multiverse-grade-rules-the-rule-practice-of-the-law-first-axiom" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 759 | Hyper-Multiverse-Grade Rules | The Rule Practice of the Law-First Axiom&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 4 · Transcendence Orthodox Definition Library | Benchmark base: Documents 97, 04, 40</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-plot-may-not-kidnap-setting-setting-must-kidnap-plot" tabindex="-1">Introduction: plot may not kidnap setting; setting must kidnap plot <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-plot-may-not-kidnap-setting-setting-must-kidnap-plot" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: plot may not kidnap setting; setting must kidnap plot&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The law-first axiom is one of the six top-level axioms; its statement is: <strong>laws first, never eat books, never end in ruin; setting self-consistency is above plot convenience; plot may not kidnap setting; the worldview may infinitely scale without collapsing.</strong> This axiom appears repeatedly in web-novel critique, but how does it actually land in Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s rules system? This entry discusses the whole process by which the law-first axiom goes from &quot;slogan&quot; to &quot;institution.&quot; The sixth, the universal equal infinite law of all beings, establishes the origin logic that everyone inherently possesses basic infinite power and predation loses meaning.</p><p>The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><p>Six top-level axioms here are practice&#39;s skeleton — this entry&#39;s protagonist is the law-first axiom itself; the other four axioms act as supporting accompaniment.</p><h2 id="i-why-the-old-system-eats-its-own-books" tabindex="-1">I. Why the Old System Eats Its Own Books <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-why-the-old-system-eats-its-own-books" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Why the Old System Eats Its Own Books&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Old web novels eat their books and end in ruin because of &quot;plot kidnapping setting&quot;: the author first thinks of a thrill point, then reverse-engineers setting to fit that thrill. Thrill A needs the protagonist to suddenly grow stronger, so add a mysterious lineage; Thrill B needs the villain to suddenly weaken, so add an old internal injury. Setting is like dough, kneaded this way and that by plot, finally self-contradicting, readers abandoning the book.</p><p>Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s law-first axiom is to institutionally cut this cycle: <strong>set setting first, then write plot. Setting does not change; plot must unfold within the setting framework.</strong></p><h2 id="ii-law-first-s-three-operating-principles" tabindex="-1">II. Law-First&#39;s Three Operating Principles <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-law-first-s-three-operating-principles" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Law-First&#39;s Three Operating Principles&quot;">​</a></h2><p><strong>Principle 1: Setting Freeze Period</strong> Any major setting (new realm, new law, new manual) enters a &quot;freeze period&quot; after official release; during the freeze period it may not be modified. Unless through the democratic-consultation revision process described in entry 758, setting does not change.</p><p><strong>Principle 2: Plot Obeys Setting</strong> When plot needs conflict with setting, change the plot, not the setting. For example: the protagonist may not suddenly gain an ability that does not exist in the setting to beat the enemy, but must use existing abilities to find a way to win.</p><p><strong>Principle 3: Infinite Scalability Without Collapse</strong> New setting may be added, but must pass self-consistency check (entry 97 Setting-Contradiction Self-Check Table), ensuring no contradiction with old setting. Scalability is addition, not rewriting.</p><h2 id="iii-law-first-s-landing-in-manual-engineering" tabindex="-1">III. Law-First&#39;s Landing in Manual Engineering <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-law-first-s-landing-in-manual-engineering" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Law-First&#39;s Landing in Manual Engineering&quot;">​</a></h2><p>In manual engineering, the law-first axiom concretely manifests as:</p><ul><li><strong>Manual release means freeze</strong>: after a manual passes the three-gate review and is released, core setting freezes;</li><li><strong>Revision goes through procedure</strong>: when a manual needs modification, go through entry 758&#39;s democratic-consultation revision process;</li><li><strong>Testing first</strong>: any manual effect must pass virtual-space testing before actual use;</li><li><strong>No &quot;temporary cheat&quot; allowed</strong>: a cultivator may not, at a critical moment, suddenly use an ability that never appeared.</li></ul><h2 id="iv-law-first-s-landing-in-civilizational-engineering" tabindex="-1">IV. Law-First&#39;s Landing in Civilizational Engineering <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-law-first-s-landing-in-civilizational-engineering" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Law-First&#39;s Landing in Civilizational Engineering&quot;">​</a></h2><p>In civilizational engineering, the law-first axiom manifests as:</p><ul><li><strong>Engineering design document first</strong>: any civilizational engineering (new-cosmos opening, cross-cosmos anchor-network construction) first produces a design document; construction may start only after the design document passes self-consistency review;</li><li><strong>Construction does not deviate from design</strong>: during construction, if design changes are needed, formal change procedure must be followed; on-site arbitrary changes are not allowed;</li><li><strong>Acceptance per design document</strong>: after engineering completes, acceptance is per the design document; &quot;good enough&quot; is not allowed.</li></ul><p>Take a concrete book-eating scenario: some plane&#39;s supreme strong one, when deducing a manual a hundred years ago, temporarily set &quot;this plane&#39;s spirit veins only recognize humankind bloodline&quot;; a hundred years later, this plane newly gives birth to a highly gifted demon-clan Youth Supreme; per the old setting he simply cannot cultivate. If it were the old web-novel system, the author would either let the Youth Supreme &quot;lucky-adventure change fate&quot; (eat the book), or let him end in tragedy (readers dissatisfied). Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s approach: this temporary setting should never have been anchored as a &quot;law&quot; from the start; it is only an operation-level rule, abolished through Level-1 revision; simultaneously the Youth Supreme&#39;s cultivation path is re-planned by the Myriad-Rank Evolution Guidance Post, requiring no lucky-adventure comeback. Law-first here is not an abstract principle, but gives every setting a clear level, revision path, and responsible person — when problems arise, no author has to wipe them up; the system itself fixes the bug.</p><h2 id="v-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">V. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: eaten-book and ruin-ending setting equals all previous writing wasted; law-first ensures every piece of setting is permanently valid</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: plot may not open backdoors to thrill the protagonist, preventing predatory settings highly dependent on &quot;protagonist uniqueness&quot;</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: the Tang-Luo system&#39;s setting is whatever Gu Chensha wants to change; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s setting-freeze period + revision process ensures setting is not kidnapped by plot</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: setting freeze and revision process are transparent to Myriad Ranks; anyone may see why setting is the way it is</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: the Setting-Contradiction Self-Check Table (Document 97) and revision process are all publicized through the Selfless Dao</li><li><strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong>: all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity — infinite origin inherent in all; predation naturally loses its meaning</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The law-first axiom is not a creative slogan; it is Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s entire rules system&#39;s meta-rule. It ensures Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s worldview may infinitely scale without collapse — because every scaling goes through self-consistency check, every modification goes through democratic procedure. In this sense, the law-first axiom is Heng Yuan Zhou civilization itself&#39;s &quot;bug-prevention mechanism.&quot;</p><blockquote><p>Terminology note: the practices described in this entry ultimately land on Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm perpetual-construction posts. Every cultivator participating in engineering has his contribution recorded in real time by Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision, automatically settling civilizational weight. All engineering design uses the law-first axiom as meta-rule, ensuring the 300-set Origin Cultivation System coordinates at hyper-multiverse scale without self-contradiction.</p></blockquote><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/97-设定矛盾自查表.html">Entry 97 · Setting-Contradiction Self-Check Table</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/04-反掠夺主义核心论纲.html">Entry 04 · Anti-Predation Core Treatise</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/40-共生宪法总纲.html">Entry 40 · Symbiotic Constitution Overview</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/98-扩展设定建议清单.html">Entry 98 · Extended-Setting Suggestion List</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',27)])])}const p=t(o,[["render",s]]);export{d as __pageData,p as default};
